  "source": {
    "description": "The owner's Secuna CSS export (portable Tailwind v4 theme CSS, supplied on 2026-10-24) is the source for appearance: every Light value and every non-tone Dark value is kept verbatim. Only the Light tones were edited by the owner; the six Dark tone pairs in the export were the stale shared defaults (in the old Blue, Orange, Purple, Pink, Teal, Violet order) and are re-derived from their Light counterparts (see tones). The source is not committed or rendered as a second theme layer.",
    "notPromoted": "The CSS is appearance data only. Identity and bookkeeping it does not encode come from the built-in conventions: id secuna, name Secuna, revision 1 and the $extensions display name. The existing saved custom Secuna theme is not read, deleted or overwritten; a saved theme stored under the id secuna is kept under the next free id (secuna-2) by the Workbench loader."
  },
  "precisionPolicy": {
    "color": "Canonical OKLCH through packages/core/src/theme/color.ts normalizeColor. Every source value is already canonical OKLCH, so normalization changes no value."
  },
