  "tones": {
    "light": "The owner-edited Light tones, kept verbatim. Tone 1 is blue (hue 246), 2 pink (350), 3 olive (115), 4 violet (300), 5 amber (71) and 6 teal (197).",
    "darkAdaptation": "Each Dark pair keeps its Light background and foreground hues exactly, so tone N is the same identity in both modes. Backgrounds keep the Light background chroma at L 0.28, between the dark popover and border (0.252) and the secondary surface (0.306), so tiles read as subdued fills on Secuna's cool, near-black surfaces. Foregrounds sit at L 0.84 with the Light foreground chroma capped at 0.08, so text stays soft rather than neon.",
    "sharedWithBuiltIns": "On 2026-10-24 every other built-in (Default, Quiet Editorial, Amber Dusk and Pocketmarket) stores an exact copy of these twelve Light and twelve Dark tones, except Pocketmarket's own Tone 1 pair (pocketmarket.conversion.json tones). The shared tone defaults (tones.conversion.json) are unchanged, so a saved custom theme without its own tone edits still renders them.",
